# Rosé Pine Dawn (KyprX), for KyprX.
# Palette: rosepinetheme.com -- Dawn
# Built against /usr/share/color-schemes/KlassyDark.colors: same sections, same keys,
# no [Colors:Header] (so the header follows the window, as Klassy does), and an explicit
# [WM] with an alpha on the active bar.

